{
  "id": "create-new-scripted-synthetics-check-tutorial",
  "title": "Interactive Guide: Create a new Scripted Synthetic Monitoring Check",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create a scripted check that requests Quickpizza and verifies its HTTP status, then choose a probe location and save the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open the editor for a scripted check."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "navigating-to-create-new-synthetics-check",
      "title": "Navigating to the Create new Check page",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home",
          "content": "Open **Synthetics** to create a check.",
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='app-init init-button']",
          "content": "If prompted, click **Get started**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[data-testid='action create check']",
          "content": "Click **Create new check**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/choose-type"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[href='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted']",
          "content": "Select **Scripted** to define the check with a k6 script.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/choose-type",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You opened the scripted check editor."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Name the check and define its HTTP status assertion."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Configure the script",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "form[data-testid='checkEditor form']:has([data-testid='data-testid Code editor container'] textarea[role='textbox']) input[data-testid='checkEditor form job']",
          "content": "Enter `Quickpizza availability` in **Job name**.",
          "targetvalue": "Quickpizza availability",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "input[data-testid='checkEditor form instance']",
          "content": "Enter `prod-quickpizza` in **Instance**.",
          "targetvalue": "prod-quickpizza",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code-block",
          "reftarget": "div[data-testid='data-testid Code editor container']",
          "language": "javascript",
          "code": "import http from \"k6/http\"\nimport { expect } from \"https://jslib.k6.io/k6-testing/0.6.1/index.js\"\n\nexport const options = {\n  vus: 1,\n  iterations: 1,\n}\n\nexport default function main() {\n  const response = http.get(\"https://quickpizza.grafana.com\")\n\n  expect(response.status).toBe(200)\n}",
          "content": "Insert the script to request Quickpizza and assert an HTTP 200 response.",
          "skippable": false,
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation uptime']",
          "content": "Click **Uptime**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "configure-script"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You configured the check identity and script."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Review the check timeout."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "guide-section-23995",
      "title": "Filling out Check details: Uptime",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "form[data-testid='checkEditor form'] div[data-testid='timeout']",
          "content": "Optionally review the maximum execution time.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation labels']",
          "content": "Click **Labels**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You reviewed how long the check can run."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Review optional labels for the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "guide-section-18646",
      "title": "Filling out Check details: Custom labels",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor genericLabelContent']",
          "content": "Optionally add labels to organize your check.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation execution']",
          "content": "Click **Execution**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You reviewed how labels organize check data."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Choose where and how often the check runs."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Filling out Check details: Execution",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "label[data-testid='checkEditor form probeLabel']:nth-match(1)",
          "content": "Select an available probe location to run the check.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='frequency-component'] [role='radiogroup'] label:contains('1m')",
          "content": "Optionally review how often the check runs.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation alerting']",
          "content": "Click **Alerting**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "configure-execution"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You selected a probe location and reviewed the frequency."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Review alerting options and save the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "section-filling-out-check-details-alerting",
      "title": "Filling out Check details: Alerting",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='form-section-alerting'] [data-testid='checkEditor formTabs content']",
          "content": "Optionally configure alert rules for failed checks.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "form[data-testid='checkEditor form'] button[data-testid='checkEditor form submit']",
          "content": "Click **Save** to create the check.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/scripted",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "id": "scripted-check-created",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[href^='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/'][href$='/edit']",
          "content": "Your scripted check is saved. Use **Edit check** to update it.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "verify": "exists-reftarget"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You saved the scripted check and opened its dashboard."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your scripted check is ready to monitor Quickpizza from the selected location."
    },
    {
      "type": "multistep",
      "content": "Set the dashboard refresh interval to **5 seconds** to watch check results.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "button",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid RefreshPicker interval button']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "action": "button",
          "reftarget": "[role='menuitemradio'][aria-label='5 seconds']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
